  "ruleText": "PART Saf-C 607 - RESERVED - REPEALED\n\nSource. #4328, eff 10-20-87; ss by #4933, eff 9-19-90; ss by #5219, eff 9-4-91; ss by #6562, Interim, eff 9-4-97, EXPIRES: 1-2-98; rpld by #6615, eff 10-25-97\n\nAPPENDIX A\n\nAPPENDIX B\n\nMATERIALS INCORPORATED BY REFERENCE\n\nRule | Material Incorporated | How Material May be Obtained\n\nSaf-C 604.02(h) | North American Standard Out-of-Service Criteria (April 1, 2023) | Commercial Vehicle Safety Alliance 6303 Ivy Lane, Suite 310 Greenbelt, MD 20770-6319 Telephone: 301.830-6143 Fax: 301.830-6144 Purchase Online: https://www.cvsa.org/inspections/out-of-service-criteria/ $50.00, plus shipping for nonmembers; or $45.00, plus shipping for members.\n\nSaf-C 604.02(h) | North American Standard Out of Service Criteria and Level VI Inspection Procedures for Commercial Vehicles Transporting Transuranics and Highway Route Controlled Quantities of Radioactive Materials as defined in 49 CFR Part 173.403 (April 1, 2022) | Commercial Vehicle Safety Alliance 6303 Ivy Lane, Suite 310 Greenbelt, MD 20770-6319 Tel: 301.830-6143 Fax: 301.830-6144 Available by email request by emailing Carlisle Smith: Carlisle Smith Carlisle.smith@cvsa.org Free of Charge www.cvsa.org",
